# Hybrid NIDS — kafka-process (.env example)

# LAN IP address of THIS machine (kafka-process) that remote clients
# (suricata-process producers, ml-engine on another laptop) should use
# to reach Kafka's PLAINTEXT_HOST listener. Leave blank to keep default
# localhost:29092 (single-machine setup).
# Example: 192.168.1.100
KAFKA_ADVERTISED_HOST=192.168.1.100
